<v Joshua's Dad>I would come home, and I would have to listen to, like, three, four hours of tape saying nothing. I mean dribble.
<v Joshua's Dad>我回家后，不得不听三四个小时的磁带，什么内容都没有。我的意思是胡言乱语。

